    "body": "I’d mistakenly thought you’d already referenced it in the initial issue text, otherwise I’d have linked that first! It’s a deep web to trace and I agree it would be helpful if Web IDL employed that phrase here — it isn’t easy to discover. The imperative path to it is at step 10.6 of [internally create a new object implementing the interface](https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#internally-create-a-new-object-implementing-the-interface).",
